;; Package wai is Arbace's WebAssembly engine (doc/wasm/WAI.md; doc/wasm/WASM-SURVEY.md §6, WAS6 (a), WA4): a module decoded from
;; the binary format, its functions translated at load into an internal code (branch targets and stack heights resolved), and an
;; interpreter over it, with the store, the linker and the hosts. Written after the specification's semantics (WebAssembly/spec at
;; tag wg-3.0, interpreter/exec/eval.ml read for the messages and the order of effects); wasmi's and wazero's designs read as
;; references, nothing of theirs converted.
